+| -------- | --------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |
+| `type`   | string          | Yes      | `"list_sessions"`                                                    |
+| `limit`  | number          | No       | Non-negative integer page size (store default 50, capped at 200)     |
+| `before` | `SessionCursor` | No       | Cursor `{updatedAt: string \| number, sessionId: string}` for paging |
